# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documents this build's ACTUAL panel/dock layout, correcting an earlier version of this
# entry (originally dated 2026-07-27) that described merging everything into a single bottom
# panel with the Dock disabled entirely. That design was drafted in entries.json but never
# applied to this machine -- checking the live cosmic-config on 2026-07-30 found
# entries.json had drifted ahead of reality. What is actually running is COSMIC's stock two-
# component layout, listed as ["Panel","Dock"] in com.system76.CosmicPanel/v1/entries
# (unchanged from default): a 'Panel' anchored to the TOP of the screen (workspace switcher
# and app-library button in the left wing, the clock centered, the full status-applet tray
# -- input sources, status area, tiling, audio, network, battery, notifications, bluetooth,
